<section class="about">

<h2>About</h2>

<p>
Ayca Akin is a Turkish illustrator and writer based in Germany.
Her work combines atmospheric storytelling, emotional symbolism,
and character-focused narratives. Drawing inspiration from folklore,
psychology, and everyday anxieties, she creates illustrations that
sit somewhere between dark humor, magical realism, and speculative fiction.

She is particularly interested in visual storytelling, editorial
illustration, literary projects, and illustrated narratives.
</p>

